  "body": "Skip to main content\nLog in\nJoin\n/\nFind a trader\nMenu\nENDORSED BY WHICH?\nJ A Peyman Painting and Decorating\n5.0\n\n2 Reviews\n\n 079 8057 7032\n [REDACTED_EMAIL]\n https://www.jamespeymanpaintinganddecorating.com/\n 165 Queens Walk, Ruislip, South Ruislip, HA4 0NW View on map\n Open NOW \nToday - 07:30–20:30 \nSee customer reviews & leave a review\nAbout\n\nThe business looks forward to speaking with you to discuss your painting and decorating needs.\n\nPlease visit the business website to see more information.\n\nWhat we do\nPainters and decorators\nExterior decorating\nInterior decorating\nWallpapering\nPainting contractors\nMy work\nCustomer reviews\nCreate a Review\nWhy you can trust these reviews\n\nAll reviews are verified as being genuine and a true customer of this trader.\n\nHow can we be so sure?\n\n100% of the reviews we publish have been through our stringent moderation process.\n\n5.0\n 2 reviews\nCustomer Service 5.0\nQuality 5.0\nValue 5.0\nRecommended\nRecommended\nby 100% of customers\nSort by \nReview date, newest first\nReview date, oldest first\nReview rating, highest first\nReview rating, lowest first\nA Bright and Breezy Hallway Makeover!\nCustomer Service \nQuality \nValue \nI'd been on James's waiting list for almost a year, and I knew it would be worth waiting for as I'd seen examples of his work. He is in popular demand for good reason! From the outset I could see it would be a good working relationship, James answered messages promptly and gave me honest and useful feedback on what paint type to go for, where to get it, etc. He provided all the trade materials and then I just chose my own colours. James took his time ensuring the prep was done properly before… read more\nCustomer in Greater London Posted on 22/08/2026 , work completed 16/06/2026\nRecommended\nDecorating and plastering of living room\nCustomer Service \nQuality \nValue \nI have used James twice now. Once to paint my walls and ceiling in my kitchen, landing and stairs. Then again to paint and plaster my living room walls and ceiling. He does an excellent job. Very professional and tidy. He is always on time and to budget. He gives a full breakdown of items purchased and labour. He will always make sure that the job he does is perfect and to your satisfaction I am going to use him again in the new year to paint my main bedroom If you use James to do some work for… read more\nCustomer in Greater London Posted on 21/08/2026 , work completed 13/04/2026\nRecommended\nWhich? Trusted Traders\nFor Consumers\nCost guide Design Gardening General information Hiring a trader Home maintenance News Plumbing Popular Advice Trader of the Month Trader of the Year Learn about Trusted Traders Terms and Conditions About our Code of Conduct Why use Which? Trusted Traders FAQs for Consumers False claims of endorsement Contact Us\nFor Businesses\nVisit trader site\nHave a question?\n029 2267 0040\nMon–Fri: 9:00–17:00\nStandard network rate.\nFollow us\n  \n\nGet the Which? app\n\nGet the power of Which? in your pocket by downloading our app, giving you on-the-go access to our reviews\n\nGot a problem?\n\nChat to a live agent or send us a message\n\nContact us\nFooter links\n\nMore from Which?\n\nAbout\nHow we are run\nPodcasts\nNewsletters\nCareers\nSitemap\nWhich? Communities\n\nMy account\n\nManage subscriptions\nMy appointments\nCancelling your membership\n\nFor experts\n\nConsumer insight\nPress office\nPolicy\n\nFor businesses\n\nUse our logo\nWork with us\nTradespeople\n\nOur legal policies\n\nAccessibility\nTerms & conditions\nPrivacy policy\nCookies\nMSA statement\n\nHelp\n\nHelp centre\nFAQs\nSubscriptions\n\n© Which? 2026",
